WEBVTT

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:10.591
[gasps]

00:00:10.766 --> 00:00:11.636
[pants]

00:00:21.341 --> 00:00:23.648
[sighs, gasps]

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:36.661
Oh, wow. I did it.

00:00:36.835 --> 00:00:40.796
Ohh, I did it. This...
This fixes everything! Yes!

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:43.015
I have brought down
this mighty beast!

00:00:43.189 --> 00:00:44.538
[dragon bellows]

00:00:47.846 --> 00:00:49.717
[heavy breathing]

00:01:01.773 --> 00:01:03.644
[guttural growl]

00:01:06.691 --> 00:01:08.519
[exhales]

00:01:11.783 --> 00:01:14.220
[exhales] I'm going
to kill you, dragon.

00:01:14.394 --> 00:01:18.181
Then I'll cut out your heart
and take it to my father.

00:01:18.355 --> 00:01:21.445
I am a Viking.
I am a Viking!

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:23.360
[grunts]

00:01:25.492 --> 00:01:27.538
[deep breathing]

00:01:38.288 --> 00:01:39.811
[moans]

00:01:55.305 --> 00:01:57.611
I did this.

00:02:07.708 --> 00:02:09.536
[knife saws rope]

00:02:14.019 --> 00:02:16.326
- [growling]
- [gasps]

00:02:17.762 --> 00:02:20.852
[low growl]

00:02:21.026 --> 00:02:23.202
[panting] Uh...

00:02:30.296 --> 00:02:32.342
[snarls]

00:02:33.386 --> 00:02:36.346
[roaring]

00:02:38.609 --> 00:02:42.918
- [roaring]
- [panting]

00:02:44.876 --> 00:02:47.792
- [dragon thumping]
- [growling]

00:02:48.445 --> 00:02:51.927
[wailing]

00:02:56.105 --> 00:02:57.758
[moans]

00:03:01.414 --> 00:03:02.850
[door opens]

00:03:11.903 --> 00:03:13.296
Hiccup.

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:15.298
Dad, uh...

00:03:15.472 --> 00:03:16.995
...I have to talk to you, Dad.

00:03:17.169 --> 00:03:19.432
I need to speak
with you, too, son.

00:03:21.391 --> 00:03:22.783
I don't want to fight dragons.

00:03:22.958 --> 00:03:24.350
It's time you learn
to fight dragons.

00:03:24.524 --> 00:03:25.873
Uh, you go first.

00:03:26.048 --> 00:03:27.397
No, you go first.

00:03:27.571 --> 00:03:29.312
All right. [sighs]

00:03:29.486 --> 00:03:30.922
You get your wish.

00:03:31.096 --> 00:03:33.490
Dragon training...
you start in the morning.

00:03:33.664 --> 00:03:35.405
Oh, man, I should have
gone first. Uh...

00:03:35.579 --> 00:03:37.537
I was thinking, you know,

00:03:37.711 --> 00:03:41.063
we have a surplus
of dragon-fighting Vikings,

00:03:41.237 --> 00:03:45.458
but do we have enough
bread-making Vikings
or small-home-repair Vikings?

00:03:45.632 --> 00:03:46.764
- You'll need this.
- [grunts]

00:03:46.938 --> 00:03:48.984
I don't want
to fight dragons.

00:03:49.158 --> 00:03:50.681
[chuckles] Come on.
Yes, you do.

00:03:50.855 --> 00:03:54.511
Rephrase.
Dad, I can't kill dragons.

00:03:54.685 --> 00:03:56.556
But you will kill dragons.

00:03:56.730 --> 00:03:59.690
No, I'm really very extra-sure
that I won't.

00:03:59.864 --> 00:04:01.692
- It's time, Hiccup.
- Can you not hear me?

00:04:01.866 --> 00:04:04.390
This is serious, son.

00:04:04.564 --> 00:04:09.352
When you carry this axe,
you carry all of us with you.

00:04:09.526 --> 00:04:13.356
Which means you walk like us,
you talk like us...

00:04:13.530 --> 00:04:15.401
...you think like us.

00:04:15.575 --> 00:04:17.621
No more of... this.

00:04:17.795 --> 00:04:19.971
You just gestured
to all of me.

00:04:20.145 --> 00:04:23.235
- Deal?
- This conversation
is very one-sided.

00:04:23.409 --> 00:04:24.497
Deal?

00:04:24.671 --> 00:04:27.587
[sighs] Deal.

00:04:29.067 --> 00:04:30.329
Good.

00:04:31.548 --> 00:04:33.506
Train hard.

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:36.335
I'll be back. Probably.

00:04:36.509 --> 00:04:38.859
And I'll be here.

00:04:39.034 --> 00:04:40.687
Maybe.

00:04:42.472 --> 00:04:43.864
Welcome to dragon training!

00:04:44.735 --> 00:04:46.432
No turning back.

00:05:03.928 --> 00:05:05.973
I hope I get
some serious burns.

00:05:06.148 --> 00:05:09.455
I'm hoping for some mauling,
like on my shoulder or back.

00:05:09.629 --> 00:05:11.936
Yeah, it's only fun
if you get a scar out of it.

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:13.329
[Hiccup] Yeah,
no kidding, right?

00:05:13.503 --> 00:05:15.635
Pain. Love it.

00:05:15.809 --> 00:05:17.463
Oh, great.
Who let him in?

00:05:17.637 --> 00:05:20.336
Let's get started!
The recruit who does best

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:23.078
will win the honor of
killing his first dragon

00:05:23.252 --> 00:05:25.341
in front
of the entire village.

00:05:25.515 --> 00:05:29.475
Hiccup already killed
a Night Fury, so does
that disqualify him?

00:05:29.649 --> 00:05:31.956
Can I transfer to the class
with the cool Vikings?

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:34.654
Don't worry.
You're small and weak...

00:05:34.828 --> 00:05:36.613
that'll make you
less of a target.

00:05:36.787 --> 00:05:38.745
They'll see you
as sick or insane

00:05:38.919 --> 00:05:42.097
and go after
the more Viking-like
teens instead. [laughs]

00:05:42.271 --> 00:05:45.622
Behind these doors are just
a few of the many species

00:05:45.796 --> 00:05:47.058
you will learn to fight!

00:05:47.232 --> 00:05:49.452
- The Deadly Nadder!
- Speed 8, armor 16.

00:05:49.626 --> 00:05:50.670
The Hideous Zippleback.

00:05:50.844 --> 00:05:52.455
Plus 11 stealth. Times 2.

00:05:52.629 --> 00:05:54.587
- The Monstrous Nightmare.
- Firepower 15.

00:05:54.761 --> 00:05:56.807
- The Terrible Terror.
- Attack 8, venom 12.

00:05:56.981 --> 00:05:58.374
Can you stop that?!

00:05:58.548 --> 00:06:01.768
And the Gronckle.

00:06:01.942 --> 00:06:03.770
- [whispers] Jaw strength 8.
- Whoa! Whoa!

00:06:03.944 --> 00:06:05.685
Wait, aren't you
teach us first?

00:06:05.859 --> 00:06:07.992
I believe
in learning on the job.

00:06:08.166 --> 00:06:10.516
[snarling]

00:06:10.690 --> 00:06:12.953
[Gobber]
Today is about survival.
If you get blasted...

00:06:13.867 --> 00:06:15.042
...you're dead!

00:06:15.217 --> 00:06:17.480
What's the first thing
you'll need?

00:06:17.654 --> 00:06:19.003
- A doctor?
- Plus 5 speed?

00:06:19.177 --> 00:06:21.701
- A shield.
- Shields. Go!

00:06:21.875 --> 00:06:24.835
Your most important piece of
equipment is your shield!

00:06:25.009 --> 00:06:29.144
If you must choose between
a sword or a shield,
take the shield!

00:06:29.318 --> 00:06:31.537
- Let go of my shield!
- There are a million shields!

00:06:31.711 --> 00:06:33.844
Take that one.
It has a flower...
girls like flowers. Aah!

00:06:34.018 --> 00:06:35.933
Oops, this one
has blood on it.

00:06:37.717 --> 00:06:39.676
- [Gobber] Tuffnut, Ruffnut!
You're out!
- What?

00:06:39.850 --> 00:06:41.634
Shields are good
for another thing.

00:06:41.808 --> 00:06:45.899
Noise! Make lots of it
to throw off a dragon's aim!

00:06:46.073 --> 00:06:49.860
- [growls]
- [Gobber] All dragons have
a limited number of shots.

00:06:50.034 --> 00:06:51.905
How many
does a Gronckle have?

00:06:52.079 --> 00:06:54.169
- Five?
- No, six!

00:06:54.343 --> 00:06:55.996
[Gobber] Correct, six!
That's one for each of you!

00:06:57.084 --> 00:06:58.869
- Fishlegs, out!
- Aaah!

00:06:59.043 --> 00:07:01.437
- Hiccup, get in there!
- Aaah!

00:07:01.611 --> 00:07:05.397
- [snarls]
- I moved into
my parents' basement.

00:07:05.571 --> 00:07:07.443
Come by sometime
and work out.

00:07:07.617 --> 00:07:08.835
You look like
you work out. Aah!

00:07:09.009 --> 00:07:10.881
[Gobber] Snotlout!
You're done!

00:07:11.055 --> 00:07:12.709
So it's just
you and me, huh?

00:07:12.883 --> 00:07:14.754
Nope, just you.

00:07:15.625 --> 00:07:17.017
[Gobber] One shot left!

00:07:17.192 --> 00:07:18.541
[panting]

00:07:18.715 --> 00:07:20.020
Hiccup!

00:07:21.718 --> 00:07:24.764
- [gasping]
- [snarls]

00:07:27.985 --> 00:07:29.900
And that's six.

00:07:30.074 --> 00:07:33.164
Go back to bed,
you overgrown sausage!

00:07:34.774 --> 00:07:37.908
You'll get another chance,
don't you worry.

00:07:38.082 --> 00:07:40.911
Remember,
a dragon will always,

00:07:41.085 --> 00:07:44.219
always go for the kill.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:51.226
- [door rattles]
- [dragon growls]

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:54.054
So... why didn't you?

